      <fuzzy_end>False</fuzzy_end>
      <locked>False</locked>
      <ends_today>False</ends_today>
      <category>Star</category>
      <description>Star documenting the creation of the Gods of Matter, Energy, Time, and Space by Life and Death. The star is also responsible for many of the laws of reality still present today.</description>
